---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: "/movement/"
pageId: "movement"
title: "The Movement"
description: "A nonprofit, nonpartisan movement that treats the cost of living as a problem to be measured and solved — not endured."
---
{#- Markup from design-source/pages/movement.html; the BODY COPY is the UNP-82 v2
    (a) rewrite, founder-approved, wired verbatim.
    Structure mapping (v2 gave copy, not markup): v2's four blocks land on the
    page's four content sections. Block 1 is a `.blk--first` — the export's own
    "first block after a hero" modifier (border-top:0) — replacing the introband,
    because v2 writes block 1 as eyebrow + lead + body, which is `.eyebrow` +
    `.lead` + `<p>`, not the introband's h2 + p. The h1 stays in the titleband, so
    v2's "h1: The Movement." is satisfied without a second h1.
    Block 4's specified buttons ([Sign the Pledge] [Get updates]) are the coral
    CTA directly below, which already renders exactly those two — so the ink
    block's own button row is dropped rather than duplicating them. -#}
<!-- SECTION: movement.Movement — title -->
<div class="titleband" data-screen-label="Movement — title"><h1>Measure it. Publish it. <span class="u-1">Bring it down.</span></h1></div>
<!-- SECTION: movement.What this is -->
{%- set mc = pageContent.movement %}
<section class="blk blk--first" data-screen-label="What this is">
  <h2 class="u-88 sec">{{ mc.whatThisIs.h2 | safe }}</h2>
  <p class="u-89 lead">{{ mc.whatThisIs.lead | safe }}</p>
{% for para in mc.whatThisIs.body %}
  <p class="u-11">{{ para | safe }}</p>
{% endfor %}
</section>

<!-- SECTION: movement.What we stand for -->
<section class="blk blk--wheat" data-screen-label="What we stand for">
  <div class="eyebrow">{{ mc.whatWeStandFor.eyebrow }}</div>
  <h2 class="u-88 sec">{{ mc.whatWeStandFor.h2 | safe }}</h2>
  <p class="u-89 lead">{{ mc.whatWeStandFor.lead | safe }}</p>
{% for para in mc.whatWeStandFor.body %}
  <p class="u-11">{{ para | safe }}</p>
{% endfor %}
</section>

<!-- SECTION: movement.How a cost gets uncosted -->
<section class="blk blk--cream" data-screen-label="How a cost gets uncosted">
  <div class="eyebrow">{{ mc.howACostGetsUncosted.eyebrow }}</div>
  <h2 class="u-88 sec">{{ mc.howACostGetsUncosted.h2 | safe }}</h2>
  <p class="u-89 lead">{{ mc.howACostGetsUncosted.intro | safe }}</p>
  <ol class="uncosted6">
{% for step in mc.howACostGetsUncosted.steps %}
    <li>{{ step | safe }}</li>
{% endfor %}
  </ol>
  <p class="u-11">{{ mc.howACostGetsUncosted.close | safe }}</p>
</section>

<!-- SECTION: movement.What taking part means -->
<section class="blk blk--cream2" data-screen-label="What taking part means">
  <div class="eyebrow">{{ mc.whatTakingPartMeans.eyebrow }}</div>
  <h2 class="u-6 sec">{{ mc.whatTakingPartMeans.h2 | safe }}</h2>
{% for para in mc.whatTakingPartMeans.body %}
  <p class="u-11">{{ para | safe }}</p>
{% endfor %}
</section>

<!-- SECTION: movement.How to take part -->
<section class="blk blk--ink u-block--ink" data-screen-label="How to take part">
  <div class="u-5 eyebrow">{{ mc.howToTakePart.eyebrow }}</div>
  <h2 class="u-91 sec">{{ mc.howToTakePart.h2 | safe }}</h2>
  <div class="path">
{% for path in mc.howToTakePart.paths %}
    <div class="p"><h3>{{ path.h3 }}</h3><p>{{ path.body | safe }}</p></div>
{% endfor %}
  </div>
  <p class="u-10">{{ mc.howToTakePart.note | safe }}</p>
</section>

<!-- SECTION: movement.Movement CTA -->
<section class="u-93 blk blk--coral" data-screen-label="Movement CTA">
  <h2 class="u-77 sec">{{ mc.cta.h2 | safe }}</h2>
  <p class="u-94 lead">{{ mc.cta.lead | safe }}</p>
  <div class="u-95">
    <a href="/pledge/" class="u-btn u-btn--ink">Sign the Pledge</a>
    <a href="#updates" class="u-btn u-btn--ghost">Get updates</a>
  </div>
</section>
